  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Variant_Chiseled_Bookshelves/BH_Variant_Chiseled_Bookshelves_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">解鎖古代知識的奧秘，並透過「變體雕花書架」模組提升您圖書館的美學品味。 </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款迷人的《Minecraft》新增內容引入了多種優雅書架，每一款皆為搭配遊戲經典木質風格而設計。 </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">沉浸在橡木、樺木、雲杉木、叢林木、金合歡木、深色橡木、緋紅木、竹、紅樹木、櫻桃木及扭曲木書架的豐富紋理與色調中。 </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">無論您是擴充附魔室，或是打造舒適的閱讀角落，「變體雕花書架」都能兼顧實用性與美觀。 </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">透過這款引人入勝的模組，探索客製化書籍收納之美！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UHsUm3.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">「變體雕花書架」為每種原版木板類型新增一種雕花書架。</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">所有紋理均已壓縮（不造成任何負面影響），以將模組檔案大小維持在絕對最低。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">所有紋理皆使用對應木板的十六進位色彩手動製作，確保外觀正確。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">已納入所有變體還原為原版物品的反合成配方，以備出現問題時使用。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">原版書架已更名為橡木，並略微調整配色，以更貼合橡木材質。</span></li></ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L0Hhc5C.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"315\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"> </span><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">曾由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Rexus2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rexus</a> 在其模組系列影片中報導</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FtNaXEcHBGc?clip=UgkxED3N_Zq2LbpUU6Ti2_VdtVBZj8N6Q6f5&clipt=EPjoAhij6AM\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><h6><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UHsUm3.png\"></span></h6><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"> </span></p><table style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMxYXtMz5r\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=452161&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"208\" height=\"50\"></a></span></td><td><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/xanthian\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=452161&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\"></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fxanthian\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Variant_Crafting/BH_VC_BisectPromo.png\" width=\"533\" height=\"80\"></a></p>",
